    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather Ingredients in Nature</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/0a6410073cd0d7bf225259e3f3d36637.poster.avif?t=1669806972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/0a6410073cd0d7bf225259e3f3d36637.webm?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/0a6410073cd0d7bf225259e3f3d36637.mp4?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>There are various resources in nature such as herbs, mushrooms, leaves and stones, and you can collect these resources by consuming energy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft Potions With the Ingredients You Collect</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/83b05fc2ff3c330671182dad43ffc4ac.poster.avif?t=1669806972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/83b05fc2ff3c330671182dad43ffc4ac.webm?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/83b05fc2ff3c330671182dad43ffc4ac.mp4?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Process the ingredients you collect, buy potion recipes from the bazaar and produce various potions by mixing ingredients into the cauldron according to the recipes you purchased.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use Potions</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/3th_gif_OP.gif?t=1669806972\" /></div><br>You can use potions to regenerate yourself, you can use damage potions for hunting, and you can give workers special potions to make their work faster and more efficient.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sell Nonessential Ingredients and Potions in the Bazaar</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/e58bee9817aa7faae8f2aac5c587bf35.poster.avif?t=1669806972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/e58bee9817aa7faae8f2aac5c587bf35.webm?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/e58bee9817aa7faae8f2aac5c587bf35.mp4?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You can earn money and reputation by selling all the ingredients and potions you collect in the bazaar.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather Ingredients in Nature</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/0a6410073cd0d7bf225259e3f3d36637.poster.avif?t=1669806972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/0a6410073cd0d7bf225259e3f3d36637.webm?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/0a6410073cd0d7bf225259e3f3d36637.mp4?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>There are various resources in nature such as herbs, mushrooms, leaves and stones, and you can collect these resources by consuming energy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft Potions With the Ingredients You Collect</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/83b05fc2ff3c330671182dad43ffc4ac.poster.avif?t=1669806972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/83b05fc2ff3c330671182dad43ffc4ac.webm?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/83b05fc2ff3c330671182dad43ffc4ac.mp4?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Process the ingredients you collect, buy potion recipes from the bazaar and produce various potions by mixing ingredients into the cauldron according to the recipes you purchased.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use Potions</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/3th_gif_OP.gif?t=1669806972\" /></div><br>You can use potions to regenerate yourself, you can use damage potions for hunting, and you can give workers special potions to make their work faster and more efficient.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sell Nonessential Ingredients and Potions in the Bazaar</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/e58bee9817aa7faae8f2aac5c587bf35.poster.avif?t=1669806972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/e58bee9817aa7faae8f2aac5c587bf35.webm?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018700/extras/e58bee9817aa7faae8f2aac5c587bf35.mp4?t=1669806972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You can earn money and reputation by selling all the ingredients and potions you collect in the bazaar.",
    "short_description": "Medieval Alchemist is an alchemist survival game set in the medieval period. Survive against the challenges of nature, collect ingredients, produce potions, sell non-essential ingredients in the bazaar, develop your character and build your living space by hiring workers.",
